					boxed reliance statement with three entries, the decision reviewed,
					the material examined and the date issued, each circled in red, with
					a red note saying the opinion holds within these bounds and no
					further.
				</desc>
				<path class="fig-sheet" d="M24 352 V8 H456 V352" />
				<text class="fig-label" x="48" y="40">INDEPENDENT REVIEW</text>
				<text class="fig-label" x="432" y="40" text-anchor="end">PAGE 1</text>
				<text class="fig-title" x="48" y="74">Opinion</text>
